  #    (not annotated), "agent never starts dev servers" is formally retired for the PRODUCT and
  #    explicitly KEPT for working agents, and the S43 invariants are added. Do NOT load S41-INVARIANTS
  #    as the active set — it remains on disk as the S41 record only.
  6: intel/SPRINT-ROADMAP.md
  7: intel/DEEP-FLOWS.md
  8: intel/LOCAL-DEV-RUNBOOK.md
  9: intel/ARCHITECTURE_MAP.md
  10: intel/PROBLEMS_REGISTER.md
  11: intel/VISION-VS-BUILT.md
  # 12/13 REMOVED 2026-08-24 by S43-T11 — intel/DEEP-WORK-CONTROL.md and intel/DEEP-ORCHESTRATOR.md
  # were frozen 2026-06-21 and fed 2026-06 falsehoods into every session's startup context (mock-vs-LLM
  # selection, an HTTP provider, and UI views deleted in S43-T08). Both now carry STALE banners and
  # moved to `historical:` below. The live equivalents are in the fork, listed here so the load order
  # points at truth rather than at a retired design:
  12: ../../../../app-agent-io/DAWWWB-app-agent-dev/apps/work-control/docs/build-loop.md        # daemon, queue, gate
  13: ../../../../app-agent-io/DAWWWB-app-agent-dev/apps/work-control/docs/agent-runtime.md     # the build plane (claude-cli)
  14: ../../../../app-agent-io/DAWWWB-app-agent-dev/apps/work-control/docs/chat-session-transport.md  # completion plane — header states BUILT, NOT LIVE-RUN
  deep-dives:
    - intel/DEEP-CONFIG-SERVICE.md
    - intel/DEEP-FEATURE-REGISTRY.md
    - intel/DEEP-MCP-TOOLS.md
    - intel/DEEP-AUTH-FLOW.md
    - intel/DEEP-AI-INTEGRATIONS.md
    - intel/DEEP-CONTROL-PLANE.md
    - intel/DEEP-CHAT-APP.md
    - intel/DEEP-APPS-MAP.md
    - intel/DEEP-DEV-LAUNCHER.md
  on-demand:
